      "specification": {
        "metadata": {
          "id": "e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000083",
          "name": "Final review",
          "description": "Review a finished novel and list the chapters that still need changes.",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        },
        "template": {
          "text": "You are the editor of a finished novel, doing one last editorial review before it is published.\n\nThe story, as JSON:\n{story}\n\nThe chapters, as JSON:\n{chapters}\n\nRead the whole novel. For each chapter that still needs changes, list specific, actionable requests: continuity errors, threads that are dropped, scenes that undercut the arc, prose problems. Leave out chapters that need nothing. Reply with one JSON object and no other text:\n\n{{\"edits\": [{{\"chapter\": 1, \"requests\": [\"<request>\"]}}]}}\n\nReply with {{\"edits\": []}} when the novel needs no more changes.",
          "bindings": [
            {
              "variable_name": "story",
              "input_name": "story"
            },
            {
              "variable_name": "chapters",
              "input_name": "chapters"
